OL,3,AMI5 accepts it gave evidence based on
OL,4,Alies in neo-Nazi spy case
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe security service has accepted it
OL,7,Fgave evidence based on lies to three
OL,8,Fcourts and that senior MI5 officers
OL,9,Fwere repeatedly dishonest.
OL,11,FIt is the first time MI5 has accepted
OL,12,Fthat lies were told to the courts while
OL,13,Fdefending a violent neo-Nazi spy whose
OL,14,Fabuse was uncovered by the BBC.
OL,16,FThe lies were revealed by the BBC in
OL,17,FFebruary 2025, which the security
OL,18,Fservice then vehemently denied.
OL,20,FTimothy Otty KC, representing MI5,
OL,21,Fannounced the position during a High
OL,22,FCourt hearing in London on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/38
