OL,3,AAt least 16 killed in attack on mosque
OL,4,Ain Pakistan
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, Pakistan's President
OL,7,FAsif Ali Zardari expressed "his best
OL,8,Fwishes for the swift recovery of those
OL,9,Finjured in the explosion."
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/38
