OL,3,ANew wild cat species discovered - with
OL,4,Aonly one known living member
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spotted cat from the forests of
OL,7,FBolivia has been confirmed as a new
OL,8,Fspecies.
OL,10,FThe small feline, about the size of a
OL,11,Fdomestic moggy, went under the radar
OL,12,Fbecause it was confused with other wild
OL,13,Fcats that share similar spots and
OL,14,Fstripes.
OL,16,FBut DNA studies show the cat is
OL,17,Factually in a class of its own,
OL,18,Fhighlighting how much remains unknown
OL,19,Fabout some of the world's most elusive
OL,20,Fmammals.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/38
