OL,3,ADozens of suspected illegal miners die
OL,4,Ain Nigerian custody
OL,5,
OL,6,FThirty-seven people accused of illegal
OL,7,Fmining in north-central Nigeria have
OL,8,Fdied in custody, local officials said.
OL,10,FPolice have set up an investigation
OL,11,Finto the deaths, which the Nigerian
OL,12,FSecurity and Civil Defence Corps
OL,13,F(NSCDC) blamed on an apparent disease
OL,14,Foutbreak.
OL,16,FHowever, an intelligence report shared
OL,17,Fwith AFP news agency suggested the
OL,18,Fgroup died because of overcrowding and
OL,19,Fpoor ventilation inside the detention
OL,20,Ffacility in Niger state.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/38
